<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-sanguozhi" book-id="b-sanguozhi-055" chapter-id="c-sanguozhi-055-appraisal" source-id="s-sanguozhi-055-appraisal">
  <p id="c-sanguozhi-055-appraisal:line141" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">評曰：凡此諸將，皆江表之虎臣，孫氏之所厚待也。以<persName id="c-sanguozhi-055-appraisal:line141:m0024" ref="v4f_db2_eqv">潘璋</persName>之不脩，<persName id="c-sanguozhi-055-appraisal:line141:m0030" ref="572_278_cba">權</persName>能忘過記功，其保據東南，宜哉！<persName id="c-sanguozhi-055-appraisal:line141:m0046" ref="djn_r5z_2w9">陳表</persName>將家支庶，而與胄子名人比翼齊衡，拔萃出類，不亦美乎！</p>
</text>
